  partName: Clip
  description: The Clip is a tiny, thin-flat fastener located at the middle-center-center
    of the engine, used to secure hoses, wires, or other components in place. Composed
    of Chrome.001, this clip provides a durable and corrosion-resistant hold, even
    in harsh environments. Interestingly, the clip's simple design and small size
    make it an easily replaceable component, reducing maintenance time and costs.
